# Information about `rapidcsv::Document::Clear`

## Function Signature

```cpp
/**
 * @brief   Clears loaded Document data.
 *
 */
void Clear();
```

## Source Code

```cpp
void Clear() {
  mData.clear();
  mColumnNames.clear();
  mRowNames.clear();
  mIsUtf16 = false;
  mIsLE = false;
  mHasUtf8BOM = false;
}
```

