## Target API Functions

1. `rapidcsv::Document::Load`
​ `Load` populates a `Document` from a CSV file path or input stream, storing parse params then reading via `ReadCsv()`. Use it to reload data with custom labels/separators/converters/line handling. Docs show file, stream/stringstream, and comment-line skipping; streams should be opened `binary`.
