​ ```

4. `rapidcsv::Converter<std::basic_string<char>>::ToStr`
​ `Converter<std::string>::ToStr` formats a value to text for CSV output. Use it via `Converter<T>` specializations to override string conversion. It uses default formatting, with higher precision for float/double. Docs show overriding `ToVal()`/`ToStr()`; no specific caveats noted.
