​ GetColumn reads a whole column by zero-based index or label and returns it as `vector<T>`, converting each cell via default or custom `ConvFunc<T>`. It skips label rows; out-of-range columns throw `std::out_of_range`. Example: `doc.GetColumn<float>("Close")`.
